 The staged consumer fixture retains its worker's exact env-exec lease receipt
 and actual typed retirement/cleanup snapshots in private evidence. Missing
 snapshots stay null; testcase success does not prove lease release or reaping.
+Source-only environment reuse applies to a changed source generation in the
+same live adapter cache and provider context. Count publish/acquire separately
+from version probes and worker env-exec; durable restart revalidation can
+require acquire. A generation-drain fixture must observe the old action's
+admission, committed new generation and successful new action before releasing
+the old action. Candidate environment preparation and in-flight drain are
+separate intervals. Preserve last-good route/pool/source identities when a
+candidate fails; repaired-source success does not admit the failed generation.
+Retain actual leases and measured cleanup separately from synthetic controls.
